      en: ["First Ramsar site in El Salvador (since 1976)", "Habitat for more than 150 bird species", "Located at the foot of the San Miguel volcano", "Famous for its floating islands of vegetation", "Important stopover for North American migratory birds", "Model project for community-based conservation"],
